nce","s":5281},{"t":"de Christ","s":5547},{"t":"!"}]},{"v":6,"t":"nous vous recommandons, frères, au nom de notre Seigneur Jésus -Christ, de vous éloigner de tout frère qui vit dans le désordre, et non selon les instructions que vous avez reçues de nous.","s":[{"t":"","s":1161},{"t":"nous vous","s":5213},{"t":"recommandons","s":3853,"m":5719},{"t":", frères","s":80},{"t":", au","s":1722},{"t":"nom","s":3686},{"t":"de notre","s":2257},{"t":"Seigneur","s":2962},{"t":"Jésus","s":2424},{"t":"-Christ","s":5547},{"t":", de vous","s":5209},{"t":"éloigner","s":4724,"m":5733},{"t":"de","s":575},{"t":"tout","s":3956},{"t":"frère","s":80},{"t":"qui vit","s":4043,"m":5723},{"t":"dans le désordre","s":814},{"t":", et","s":2532},{"t":"non","s":3361},{"t":"selon","s":2596},{"t":"les instructions","s":3862},{"t":"que","s":3739},{"t":"vous avez reçues","s":3880,"m":5627},{"t":"de","s":3844},{"t":"nous","s":2257},{"t":"."}]},{"v":7,"t":"Vous savez vous-mêmes comment il faut nous imiter, car nous n’avons pas vécu parmi vous dans le désordre.","s":[{"t":"","s":1063},{"t":"Vous savez","s":1492,"m":5758},{"t":"vous-mêmes","s":846},{"t":"comment","s":4459},{"t":"il faut","s":1163,"m":5748},{"t":"nous","s":2248},{"t":"imiter","s":3401,"m":5738},{"t":", car","s":3754},{"t":"nous n’avons pas","s":3756},{"t":"vécu parmi","s":1722},{"t":"vous","s":5213},{"t":"dans le désordre","s":812,"m":5656},{"t":"."}]},{"v":8,"t":"Nous n’avons mangé gratuitement le pain de personne; mais, dans le travail et dans la peine, nous avons été nuit et jour à l’œuvre, pour n’être à charge à aucun de vous.","s":[{"t":"Nous n","s":3761},{"t":"’avons mangé","s":5315,"m":5627},{"t":"gratuitement","s":1432},{"t":"le pain","s":740},{"t":"de","s":3844},{"t":"personne","s":5100},{"t":"; mais","s":235},{"t":", dans","s":1722},{"t":"le travail","s":2873},{"t":"et","s":2532},{"t":"dans la peine","s":3449},{"t":", nous avons été nuit","s":3571},{"t":"et","s":2532},{"t":"jour","s":2250},{"t":"à l’œuvre","s":2038,"m":5740},{"t":", pour","s":4314},{"t":"n","s":3361},{"t":"’être à charge","s":1912,"m":5658},{"t":"à aucun","s":5100},{"t":"de vous","s":5216},{"t":"."}]},{"v":9,"t":"Ce n’est pas que nous n’en eussions le droit, mais nous avons voulu vous donner en nous-mêmes un modèle à imiter.","s":[{"t":"Ce n’est pas","s":3756},{"t":"que","s":3754},{"t":"nous n","s":3756},{"t":"’en eussions","s":2192,"m":5719},{"t":"le droit","s":1849},{"t":", mais","s":235},{"t":"","s":2443},{"t":"nous avons voulu vous","s":5213},{"t":"donner","s":1325,"m":5632},{"t":"en nous-mêmes","s":1438},{"t":"","s":2248},{"t":"un modèle","s":5179},{"t":"à","s":1519},{"t":"imiter","s":3401,"m":5738},{"t":"."}]},{"v":10,"t":"Car, lorsque nous étions chez vous, nous vous disions expressément: Si quelqu’un ne veut pas travailler, qu’il ne mange pas non plus.","s":[{"t":"Car","s":1063},{"t":",","s":2532},{"t":"lorsque","s":3753},{"t":"nous étions","s":2258,"m":5713},{"t":"chez","s":4314},{"t":"vous","s":5209},{"t":",","s":5124},{"t":"nous vous","s":5213},{"t":"disions expressément","s":3853,"m":5707},{"t":": Si","s":3754},{"t":"quelqu","s":1536},{"t":"’un ne veut","s":2309,"m":5719},{"t":"pas","s":3756},{"t":"travailler","s":2038,"m":5738},{"t":", qu’il ne mange","s":2068,"m":5720},{"t":"pas","s":3366},{"t":"non plus."}]},{"v":11,"t":"Nous apprenons, cependant, qu’il y en a parmi vous quelques-uns qui vivent dans le désordre, qui ne travaillent pas, mais qui s’occupent de futilités.","s":[{"t":"Nous apprenons","s":191,"m":5719},{"t":", cependant","s":1063},{"t":", qu’il y en a parmi","s":1722},{"t":"vous","s":5213},{"t":"quelques-uns","s":5100},{"t":"qui vivent","s":4043,"m":5723},{"t":"dans le désordre","s":814},{"t":", qui ne travaillent","s":2038,"m":5740},{"t":"pas","s":3367},{"t":", mais","s":235},{"t":"qui s’occupent de futilités","s":4020,"m":5740},{"t":"."}]},{"v":12,"t":"Nous invitons ces gens-là, et nous les exhortons par le Seigneur Jésus -Christ, à manger leur propre pain, en travaillant paisiblement.","s":[{"t":"","s":1161},{"t":"Nous invitons","s":3853,"m":5719},{"t":"ces gens-là","s":5108},{"t":", et","s":2532},{"t":"nous les exhortons","s":3870,"m":5719},{"t":"par","s":1223},{"t":"le","s":2257},{"t":"Seigneur","s":2962},{"t":"Jésus","s":2424},{"t":"-Christ","s":5547},{"t":",","s":2443},{"t":"à manger","s":2068,"m":5725},{"t":"leur propre","s":1438},{"t":"pain","s":740},{"t":", en travaillant","s":2038,"m":5740},{"t":"paisiblement","s":3326},{"t":"","s":2271},{"t":"."}]},{"v":13,"t":"Pour vous, frères, ne vous lassez pas de faire le bien.","s":[{"t":"","s":1161},{"t":"Pour vous","s":5210},{"t":", frères","s":80},{"t":", ne vous lassez","s":1573,"m":5661},{"t":"pas","s":3361},{"t":"de faire le bien","s":2569,"m":5723},{"t":"."}]},{"v":14,"t":"Et si quelqu’un n’obéit pas à ce que nous disons par cette lettre, notez -le, et n’ayez point de communication avec lui, afin qu’il éprouve de la honte.","s":[{"t":"Et","s":1161},{"t":"si quelqu’un","s":1536},{"t":"n’obéit","s":5219,"m":5719},{"t":"pas","s":3756},{"t":"à ce que nous","s":2257},{"t":"disons","s":3056},{"t":"par","s":1223},{"t":"cette lettre","s":1992},{"t":", notez","s":4593,"m":5732},{"t":"-le","s":5126},{"t":", et","s":2532},{"t":"n’ayez point","s":3361},{"t":"de communication","s":4874,"m":5732},{"t":"avec lui","s":846},{"t":", afin","s":2443},{"t":"qu’il éprouve de la honte","s":1788,"m":5652},{"t":"."}]},{"v":15,"t":"Ne le regardez pas comme un ennemi, mais avertissez -le comme un frère.","s":[{"t":"","s":2532},{"t":"Ne le regardez","s":2233,"m":5737},{"t":"pas","s":3361},{"t":"comme","s":5613},{"t":"un ennemi","s":2190},{"t":", mais","s":235},{"t":"avertissez","s":3560,"m":5720},{"t":"-le comme","s":5613},{"t":"un frère","s":80},{"t":"."}]},{"v":16,"t":"Que le Seigneur de la paix vous donne lui-même la paix en tout temps, de toute manière! Que le Seigneur soit avec vous tous!","s":[{"t":"","s":1161},{"t":"Que le Seigneur","s":2962},{"t":"de la paix","s":1515},{"t":"vous","s":5213},{"t":"donne","s":1325,"m":563